<title>PORTUGAL: Merrill Lynch launches Portugal Telecom warrants.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch launches Portugal Telecom warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch is launching one million UK-style warrants on the shares of Portugal Telecom at a strike price of 7,550 escudos, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>Portugal Telecom shares were up 141 escudos at 7,591 escudos on Tuesday having earlier touched a high of 7,694.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113125</p>
</text>
